{
  "scene_id": "scene.027_the_claiming",
  "description": "CHAPTER 27: THE CLAIMING",
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "geralt",
      "name": "Geralt",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      },
      "type": "character"
    },
    {
      "id": "oreck",
      "name": "Oreck",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 5,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      },
      "type": "character"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 8,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Oreck,\"",
        "line": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 11,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nehereti,\"",
        "line": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 15,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I need your help,\"",
        "line": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 17,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can give you what was given to me. Speech. The ability to communicate beyond gestures. To speak as equals rather than master and slave, overseer and property.\"",
        "line": 32
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 19,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But it requires trust. Requires allowing me to touch your mind as the Nehereti touched mine. And I know\u2014\"",
        "line": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 22,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is choice,\"",
        "line": 41
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 25,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"If you accept, we become brothers. Allies by choice rather than circumstance. And together, we claim what the Aeon Keepers prepared for humanity's liberation.\"",
        "line": 46
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 61,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I...\"",
        "line": 97
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 64,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can speak,\"",
        "line": 102
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 66,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes,\"",
        "line": 105
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 68,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Why?\"",
        "line": 109
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Because,\"",
        "line": 111
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 71,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"There's armor waiting. Power the Aeon Keepers prepared. Dragon Mail infused with consciousness of being who sacrificed everything to circumvent laws that prevented direct intervention. But reaching it\u2014claiming it\u2014will require facing whatever guards it.\"",
        "line": 115
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 72,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And I cannot do that alone.\"",
        "line": 117
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 74,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You ask me to fight beside you,\"",
        "line": 121
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 75,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Brother,\"",
        "line": 123
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 79,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Will you come with me? Will you help me claim what the Aeon Keepers prepared? Will you witness my transformation and ensure I remain myself despite power I'm about to receive?\"",
        "line": 129
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 82,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I will come,\"",
        "line": 134
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Besides. Someone needs to ensure you don't do anything stupidly heroic and get yourself killed before this rebellion truly begins.\"",
        "line": 138
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 86,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then let's go claim my stupidly heroic armor and see if we survive the attempt.\"",
        "line": 142
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 102,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tell me about them. The Nehereti. The Aeon Keepers. The beings who gave you speech and now offer armor.\"",
        "line": 173
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 104,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nehereti are...\"",
        "line": 177
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 106,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They're Zaron's creations,\"",
        "line": 180
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 110,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Not die. Transform. Zaron chose to fragment his consciousness\u2014to break himself into pieces and bind those pieces to armor\u2014because Aeon Keepers are forbidden from direct intervention. Galactic law. Universal principle. They observe but cannot act.\"",
        "line": 186
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 111,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But a weapon can act,\"",
        "line": 188
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 112,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exactly.\"",
        "line": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"There,\"",
        "line": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 121,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Defensible position. Single approach. Whatever guards the armor will have significant advantage. We'll be exposed during final approach, vulnerable to ranged attacks or environmental hazards.\"",
        "line": 204
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 125,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No,\"",
        "line": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 127,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And to force that acknowledgment, I need to become more than former slave with stolen telekinesis and parasitic symbiote.\"",
        "line": 213
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 131,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Your parasite has opinions.\"",
        "line": 221
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 132,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"My partner has opinions,\"",
        "line": 223
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 135,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What was it like?\"",
        "line": 228
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 138,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Every day. Every moment. Every time I raised whip or enforced quota or punished resistance. But questioning and acting on questions are different things entirely.\"",
        "line": 233
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 139,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Anunnaki don't just modify bodies. They modify minds. Condition responses. Create neural pathways that make obedience feel natural, rebellion feel wrong at fundamental level that transcends conscious thought.\"",
        "line": 235
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 141,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I knew it was evil. Knew I was participating in atrocity. But knowing and stopping are separated by gap wider than any physical distance. It took watching you\u2014former slave who should have been broken beyond recovery\u2014defy what should have been undefiable.\"",
        "line": 239
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 142,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You showed me that gap could be crossed. That conditioning could be overcome. That choice was possible even when everything suggested otherwise.\"",
        "line": 241
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 144,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And now?\"",
        "line": 245
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 145,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No.\"",
        "line": 247
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 147,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"That choice is the only thing that makes me person rather than tool.\"",
        "line": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 162,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Or it's trap,\"",
        "line": 271
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 163,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Only one way to find out.\"",
        "line": 273
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 169,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Who built this?\"",
        "line": 283
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 171,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nehereti said it predates Anunnaki arrival. Perhaps even predates human civilization. Tiamat's children, maybe? Beings who existed before the shattering?\"",
        "line": 286
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 179,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The guardian,\"",
        "line": 297
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 181,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Stay behind me initially,\"",
        "line": 301
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 183,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're partners\u2014\"",
        "line": 304
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 184,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And partners use tactics rather than heroic stupidity. I'm armored. Larger. More durable. You're\"",
        "line": 306
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 192,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Fine. But at first sign you're overwhelmed, I'm joining the fight.\"",
        "line": 317
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 193,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Expected nothing less.\"",
        "line": 319
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 222,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I was the blade that cut the unworthy... the chain that broke the defiant... the guardian who forgot what she guarded.\"",
        "line": 368
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 224,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tell me, mortals\u2014whose freedom do you wear in your skin?\"",
        "line": 372
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 226,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We seek the Dragon Mail,\"",
        "line": 376
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 227,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Guard?\"",
        "line": 378
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 230,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You, slave-who-speaks. You, who carries parasite and seeks god-consciousness. You think yourself worthy?\"",
        "line": 383
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 235,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"FOOLISH!\"",
        "line": 392
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 257,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You...\"",
        "line": 424
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 263,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Phase one complete,\"",
        "line": 432
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 265,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But recognition alone is insufficient. Now\u2014survive the doubt.\"",
        "line": 436
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 282,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Illusion!\"",
        "line": 462
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 295,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"NO!\"",
        "line": 479
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 304,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I'm not...\"",
        "line": 491
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 307,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The armor,\"",
        "line": 496
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 309,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I'll be plural. Contested. Accountable not through external authority but through internal disagreement.\"",
        "line": 499
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 311,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You speak wisdom,\"",
        "line": 503
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 313,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I already am capable of atrocity,\"",
        "line": 506
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 315,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can't promise I'll never abuse power. Can't guarantee I'll always choose correctly. But I can promise I'll never stop questioning myself. Never stop listening to voices that challenge me. Never become so certain of righteousness that I stop doubting my choices.\"",
        "line": 510
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 318,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Phase two complete. The trial of doubt. You acknowledge darkness within. Accept plurality rather than certainty. Perhaps...\"",
        "line": 516
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 320,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"One phase remains. The hardest. The one that determines whether you claim armor or die attempting.\"",
        "line": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 322,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Free me,\"",
        "line": 524
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 323,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And in exchange, I grant you passage to what you seek.\"",
        "line": 526
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 327,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How?\"",
        "line": 534
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 328,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Not you alone,\"",
        "line": 536
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 331,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tell me what to do.\"",
        "line": 541
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 332,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The central sigil,\"",
        "line": 543
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 337,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Oreck, wait\u2014\"",
        "line": 550
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 339,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No.\"",
        "line": 553
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 352,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I...\"",
        "line": 573
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 355,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I reject it. All of it. The chains I wore. The chains I forged. The chains that bind any consciousness to will not their own.\"",
        "line": 578
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 367,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"FREE!\"",
        "line": 597
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 370,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You...\"",
        "line": 602
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 373,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I grant you gift equal to what you granted me. Choice. Agency. The ability to reject what you were made to be and become what you choose.\"",
        "line": 607
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 381,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I...\"",
        "line": 619
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 383,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Free,\"",
        "line": 622
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 386,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The armor you seek lies beyond the final passage,\"",
        "line": 627
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 388,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And when you wear divine armor, when you wield power of fragmented Aeon Keeper, remember what you learned here. That chains can be broken. That binding is choice not necessity. That freedom demands eternal vigilance against those who would constrain it\u2014including yourself.\"",
        "line": 631
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 389,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Go. Claim your destiny. And may you wield power with wisdom you've demonstrated today.\"",
        "line": 633
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 392,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I return to what I was before binding. Before chains. Before divine authority made me weapon. Thank you, champions. For giving me what I could not give myself.\"",
        "line": 638
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 393,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Freedom.\"",
        "line": 640
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 396,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Can you continue?\"",
        "line": 646
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 398,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes. Better than before, actually. She didn't just heal damage\u2014she freed me. Truly freed me. I'm...\"",
        "line": 650
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 436,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I have to handle it. Earth needs this. Liberation requires this. And\"",
        "line": 706
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 442,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Now go. Claim what the Aeon Keepers prepared. Become what Earth needs you to be.\"",
        "line": 714
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 481,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"BOTH OF YOU SHUT UP!\"",
        "line": 768
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 517,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"THIRD RULE,\"",
        "line": 821
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 528,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Geralt?\"",
        "line": 838
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 531,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes\"",
        "line": 843
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 534,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Obviously\"",
        "line": 846
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 537,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Still me. Just... more crowded than before.\"",
        "line": 851
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 551,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Perhaps,\"",
        "line": 872
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 556,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The armor,\"",
        "line": 880
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 572,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"See?\"",
        "line": 904
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 576,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We should return to the compound,\"",
        "line": 910
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 583,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is going to be interesting,\"",
        "line": 920
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 605,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The compound is three miles west,\"",
        "line": 954
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 607,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can manage. Slowly. But I can manage.\"",
        "line": 958
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 610,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What does it feel like? Having three consciousnesses sharing one mind?\"",
        "line": 964
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 612,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Like... like being in room with two other people who never leave. Who have opinions about everything you do. Who can't be ignored even when you desperately want solitude.\"",
        "line": 968
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 613,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But also,\"",
        "line": 970
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 616,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Applicator provides logic. Cold assessment divorced from emotion. Zaron provides passion. Conviction that sometimes overrides practical considerations. And I'm...\"",
        "line": 975
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 617,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The balance,\"",
        "line": 977
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 619,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exactly.\"",
        "line": 980
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 625,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Are you ready?\"",
        "line": 989
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 627,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No,\"",
        "line": 993
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 635,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It's me,\"",
        "line": 1007
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 637,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is Dragon Mail. Armor infused with consciousness of Aeon Keeper who sacrificed everything to circumvent laws preventing direct intervention. I'm bonded to it now. Soul-linked until death or miracle separates us.\"",
        "line": 1011
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 647,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes,\"",
        "line": 1028
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 648,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But also more now. Carrying consciousnesses that challenge me, that prevent certainty, that ensure I never make decisions in isolation.\"",
        "line": 1030
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 650,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nehereti gave me speech. Gave me spirit-walking. Gifts stolen when Anunnaki modified our ancestors. I can share these gifts. Give you voice. Give all of us the ability to communicate beyond gesture-language's limitations.\"",
        "line": 1034
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 652,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Let me give you what was given to me. Let me restore what was stolen. But\"",
        "line": 1038
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 665,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I...\"",
        "line": 1058
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 668,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I am Mika,\"",
        "line": 1063
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 699,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I understand,\"",
        "line": 1109
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 701,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But know this: speech or no speech, names or no names, you remain mine. Remain protected. Remain valued. Your refusal doesn't diminish your place in what we're building. Your trauma doesn't make you less than those who can accept the gift.\"",
        "line": 1113
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 706,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Anunnaki fled Earth but won't stay gone. They'll return\u2014with reinforcements, with better strategies, with determination to reclaim what they view as rightful property. We have time now. Weeks, maybe months. But not forever.\"",
        "line": 1122
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 708,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We use that time to prepare. To organize. To become more than freed slaves hiding in single compound. There are three more enslavement camps within marching distance. Three more populations living under Anunnaki authority. Three more opportunities to demonstrate that resistance is possible, that liberation can succeed, that Earth doesn't belong to empire that treats conscious beings as resources to be extracted.\"",
        "line": 1126
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 710,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I'm not asking you to follow me into war. Not demanding sacrifice. Only offering choice\u2014the same choice I made when claiming this armor. To accept that freedom requires eternal vigilance. That liberation isn't single victory but continuous struggle. That becoming truly free means being willing to fight for others still enslaved.\"",
        "line": 1130
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 712,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Where you lead, I follow. Not from compulsion. Not from fear. But from recognition that you've proven yourself worthy of trust. That you could have used power for domination but chose liberation instead.\"",
        "line": 1134
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 718,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we begin training tomorrow. Teaching combat. Organizing supply lines. Preparing for campaigns that will test everything we've built. The first camp liberation will be crucible\u2014succeed, and others will join us. Fail, and we prove the Anunnaki correct that resistance is futile.\"",
        "line": 1144
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 719,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We won't fail,\"",
        "line": 1146
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 720,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And that cause\u2014that purpose\u2014is worth any sacrifice. Worth any risk. Worth transforming into weapon if that's what liberation demands.\"",
        "line": 1148
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 744,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I will,\"",
        "line": 1186
      }
    }
  ],
